# Retired — do not use FML or local Firebolt as memory

This rule used to require the Firebolt Memory Layer and a local Firebolt Core semantic layer. That path is retired.

Use Relate. Follow `cursor-rules/laml-memory.mdc` and `AGENTS.md`. The shared store is `$HOME/.relate/memory`, queried with Cypher.
